@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Login Flow (Corrected Architecture)


actor "User's Browser" as Browser
participant "NGINX Ingress Controller" as Ingress
participant "Frontend Pod (nginx)" as FrontendPod
participant "Vue.js SPA\n(in Browser)" as FrontendApp
participant "Authentication Service Pod" as AuthServicePod
database "PostgreSQL\n(Authentication DB)" as DBAuth

' Flusso 1: L'utente carica la pagina iniziale (Single-Page Application)
User -> Browser: Accesses application URL (e.g., https://peer-review)

Browser -> Ingress: **GET /**\n(HTTPS Request)
activate Ingress

note right of Ingress
  **Path-Based Routing:**
  Path "/" matches the rule for the
  frontend service.
end note
Ingress -> FrontendPod: **GET /**\n(HTTP Request, via Frontend Service)
activate FrontendPod
FrontendPod --> Ingress: index.html, app.js, etc.
deactivate FrontendPod

Ingress --> Browser: Serves SPA static files
deactivate Ingress

Browser -[#black]> FrontendApp: Loads and renders SPA, showing Login UI

' Flusso 2: L'utente esegue il login
User -> FrontendApp: Submits Login (email, password)
activate FrontendApp

FrontendApp -> Ingress: **POST /auth/login** (HTTPS)\n{email, password}
activate Ingress

note right of Ingress
  **Path-Based Routing:**
  Path "/auth/login" matches the
  regex rule `/auth(/.*)?$`.
  The request is forwarded to the
  Authentication Service.
end note
Ingress -> AuthServicePod: **POST /auth/login** (HTTP)\n{email, password}
note right of Ingress: Path is preserved (no rewrite)
activate AuthServicePod

AuthServicePod -> DBAuth: findUserByEmail(email)
activate DBAuth
DBAuth --> AuthServicePod: userData / null
deactivate DBAuth

group Internal Logic
    AuthServicePod -> AuthServicePod: Verify password hash
    alt Password OK
        AuthServicePod -> AuthServicePod: Generate JWT
    end
end

AuthServicePod --> Ingress: HTTP 200 OK\n{jwt_token, user_info}
deactivate AuthServicePod

Ingress --> FrontendApp: HTTPS 200 OK\n{jwt_token, user_info}
deactivate Ingress

alt#LightCoral #White Login Successful
    FrontendApp -> FrontendApp: Store token in localStorage
    FrontendApp -> User: Redirect to Dashboard
else Login Failed
    FrontendApp -> User: Show Error Message
end
deactivate FrontendApp

@enduml